~ start
do! MusicManager._fade_out()
do CutsceneManager.player_face("right")
do CameraManager.create_camera(Vector2(12500.0,100), 0.7, 1.5, "CUBIC", "EASE_IN_OUT")
Fenn: Uh... Az?[wait=0.3] There's a big wall of ice in front of the door again.
Az: Okay, where are you?[wait=0.3] [do! CutsceneManager.play_sound("Cough")][i]cough[/i]. What does the room look like?
Fenn: It's... like a big room with plants and books and stuff.
Az annoy: [shake level=5 rate=20]Ugh[/shake]. So he's blocked off the [color="0B4F4A"]Workshop[/color], then.
Wizard: [font_size=70][wave freq=10 amp=30]Thou shalt never reach me whilst I am in here![/wave][/font_size]
Az: You turned off the heater, [wait=0.3]didn't you?
Wizard grit: [font_size=80][shake level=10 rate=30]WHAT? HOW DIDST THOU KNOWETH?[/shake][/font_size]
Az annoy: I dunno, [wait=0.3]maybe it's 'cause you're in [font_size=60][shake level=7 rate=30]MY [color="blue"]WORKSHOP[/color].[/shake][/font_size]
Wizard awkward: Ah... [font_size=40]thou art correct...[/font_size][font_size=30] my bad.[/font_size]
Az: [i]sigh[/i]. Fenn, [color="521FA6"]look around the Den for a grate[/color]. You might be able to reach the heater that way. Think you could turn it on?
Fenn starry: Oooh yay! [wave freq=7 amp=30]A new page in the hero's journey-eth![/wave]
do EventBus.interrupt_dialogue.emit("0.5")
Az annoy: I swear, [wait=0.3]if you start talking like that too-
Wizard grit: [font_size=60]NO! [/font_size]Whatever thou art planning,[wait=0.3] [font_size=40]um,[/font_size][wait=0.3] [font_size=30]stop that right now.[/font_size]
Az annoy: Hey, [shake level=7 rate=20][i]Wizard boy[/i].[/shake] You touch anything in there, you [shake level=7 rate=30]WILL[/shake] regret it.
Wizard awkward: Um. [font_size=35]Ahem.[/font_size] No promises.
Az: [shake level=7 rate=30]Ugh[/shake], [wait=0.3]I [i]swear[/i]- [wait=0.3]Fenn, I'll be there as soon as I can.
Fenn: Okay-eth!
do! MusicManager._fade_in()
do EventFlags.set_flag("6-AzWs-Arrive-Den", true)
=> END